ge of expressive and beautifully crafted animations of your everyday activities with Mio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice Acting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every line spoken by Mio is fully voiced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike! Open World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon dive shakes things up with slightly different terrains, enemies, and treasures, ensuring endless replayability and challenges. Learn and adapt with each exploration to uncover deeper dungeon secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACT (Armed Combat &amp; Tactics) Real-Time Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditching turn-based for real-time combat with keyboard and mouse, this game lets you mix skills and gear for a fresh fighting feel. Each dungeon level throws unique challenges your way, demanding tactical skill use and strategy to advance. Dive deeper, and you'll unlock new abilities and gear to beef up your battle prowess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238940/extras/db152c9ede1d112bc377c6d22114d099.poster.avif?t=1771397097\" width=780 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238940/extras/db152c9ede1d112bc377c6d22114d099.webm?t=1771397097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NLCH"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238940/29d61b914760258c2c14aeb1db05871ea95e2354/header.jpg?t=1771397097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"h